@startuml
title TaskFlow — Deployment Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

node "Desktop (Tauri v2)" as TAURI_APP {
  package "Frontend (WebView)" {
    [HTML/CSS/JS\nFrontend Bundle]
  }
  package "Backend (Rust)" {
    [Tauri Commands\n(IPC Bridge)]
    package "Services Layer" {
      [AuthService]
      [TodoService]
      [TaskService]
      [ChatService]
      [GroupService]
      [RepositoryService]
      [CascadeService]
    }
    package "Data Providers" {
      [JsonProvider\n(Local JSON Files)]
      [MongoProvider\n(MongoDB)]
    }
  }
}

database "Local Storage" {
  [JSON Files\n~/.taskflow/*.json]
}

database "MongoDB Atlas" as MONGO {
  [users]
  [todos]
  [tasks]
  [subtasks]
  [groups]
  [rooms]
  [chats]
  [profiles]
}

cloud "GitHub API" as GITHUB {
  [Issues]
  [Repositories]
}

TAURI_APP --> JsonProvider : read/write\nlocal data
TAURI_APP --> MONGO : sync\ncloud data
TAURI_APP --> GITHUB : oauth\nintegration
JsonProvider --> "Local Storage"
MongoProvider --> MONGO

note bottom of TAURI_APP
  Tauri v2.11 with plugins:
  - tauri-plugin-mcp-bridge (MCP tools)
  - tauri-plugin-http
  - tauri-plugin-log
  - tauri-plugin-shell
  - tauri-plugin-opener
end note

note over JsonProvider
  nosql_orm with JsonProvider
  JSON files stored at app_data_dir
end note

note over MongoProvider
  nosql_orm with MongoProvider
  Connection: mongo_db_uri / mongo_db_name
end note
@enduml
